      "created_at": "2024-01-24T12:45:27.256Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Per episode 81</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>December ’12: <em>FF</em> <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#752</span>, Deadline event begins, major crossover.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Then the next time Deadline is mentioned is him becoming Lifeline</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>January ’15: <em>TotB</em> vol. 4 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#62</span>, Trickster Kismet (tied into the <em>DC</em> limited). DW* vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#1</span> relaunch. <em>VotV</em> vol. 3 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#50</span>, flashback with Naturalist and Deadline which sets up…<br>\nFebruary ’15: <em>Cosmic Redemption</em> one-shot that sets up Lifeline and what’s going on with the Enclave moving forward.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>So it was only one major attack that we know of.</p>\n<p>If I look up first appearances regarding Deadline using WalkingTarget’s discord bot it gives this info:<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c6535af0c4296e547c6f2a590de74c3069f8b8d9.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/c6535af0c4296e547c6f2a590de74c3069f8b8d9\" title=\"IMG_2001\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6535af0c4296e547c6f2a590de74c3069f8b8d9_2_690x231.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_2001\" data-base62-sha1=\"sit7RSmxcQskE1vV9yLV3SYWapP\" width=\"690\" height=\"231\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6535af0c4296e547c6f2a590de74c3069f8b8d9_2_690x231.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6535af0c4296e547c6f2a590de74c3069f8b8d9_2_1035x346.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/c6535af0c4296e547c6f2a590de74c3069f8b8d9_2_1380x462.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"38393D\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class